ning & Communication\",\r\n    \"subareaId\": \"SA-1\",\r\n    \"objective\": \"Development of English Language, Borrowings, and Regional Variation\",\r\n    \"question\": \"A word-for-word translation of a foreign phrase is known as a:\",\r\n    \"stem\": \"A word-for-word translation of a foreign phrase is known as a:\",\r\n    \"options\": [\r\n      \"Pidgin\",\r\n      \"Calque\",\r\n      \"Borrowing\",\r\n      \"Neologism\"\r\n    ],\r\n    \"answer\": \"Calque\",\r\n    \"correctIndex\": 1,\r\n    \"rationales\": [\r\n      \"Pidgin is a simplified contact language, not a translation method.\",\r\n      \"Correct! A calque translates the structure literally (skyscraper = gratte-ciel).\",\r\n      \"Borrowing is general; calque is specifically literal translation.\",\r\n      \"Neologism is a newly coined word.\"\r\n    ],\r\n    \"difficulty\": 2,\r\n    \"mode\": \"Drill\",\r\n    \"type\": \"mcq\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"id\": \"Q331\",\r\n    \"subarea\": \"Meaning & Communication\",\r\n    \"subareaId\": \"SA-1\",\r\n    \"objective\": \"Development of English Language, Borrowings, and Regional Variation\",\r\n    \"question\": \"The study of word origins and their historical changes is called:\",\r\n    \"stem\": \"The study of word origins and their historical changes is called:\",\r\n    \"options\": [\r\n      \"Etymology\",\r\n      \"Morphology\",\r\n      \"Phonology\",\r\n      \"Syntax\"\r\n    ],\r\n    \"answer\": \"Etymology\",\r\n    \"correctIndex\": 0,\r\n    \"rationales\": [\r\n      \"Correct! Etymology studies word origins and semantic evolution.\",\r\n      \"Morphology studies word structure.\",\r\n      \"Phonology studies sound systems.\",\r\n      \"Syntax studies sentence structure.\"\r\n    ],\r\n    \"difficulty\": 1,\r\n    \"mode\": \"Drill\",\r\n    \"type\": \"mcq\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"id\": \"Q332\",\r\n    \"subarea\": \"Meaning & Communication\",\r\n    \"subareaId\": \"SA-1\",\r\n    \"objective\": \"Development of